that you don't know how to do that.

00:10:09.768 --> 00:10:10.619
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:10:10.619 --> 00:10:11.452
- But the thing...

00:10:11.452 --> 00:10:12.583
- You did that very, very well then.

00:10:12.583 --> 00:10:15.150
(people laughing)

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:15.983
- No, that's true.

00:10:15.983 --> 00:10:18.420
We always make jokes, but Jessi,

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:19.620
the singer that works with me on the show,

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:21.630
she's so good at singing off
key and being funny about it

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:23.040
and it is hard to do.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:23.873
- [Rita] Yeah.

00:10:23.873 --> 00:10:24.706
- When you're so trained to not,

00:10:24.706 --> 00:10:25.766
you're trained to be on key.

00:10:25.766 --> 00:10:26.599
- Exactly.

00:10:26.599 --> 00:10:27.885
- That is very hard to do but
I thought you looked elegant,

00:10:27.885 --> 00:10:29.013
I liked it.

